WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
In the lobby, a user holds a phone and faces the Lingxi X2.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The first instruction asks X2 to get water from a vending machine.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.200
The inset marks a local navigation goal in the robot’s camera view.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.500
After the destination changes to Lawson, X2 turns and crosses the lobby.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:46.500
The robot follows the corridor to the glass doors.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:56.500
X2 emerges into an outdoor plaza shared with other robots and pedestrians.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:11.000
The route continues along the outdoor walkway between buildings.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:25.000
The Lawson sign comes into view as X2 approaches the store.
